(2918548, 408624, 327, '<td valign="top">lol he has such an engaging smile. Love the pose and would only wish the duck/hand was a bit lower. That aside this is very nice. Good light, color. Best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'lol he has such an engaging smile. Love the pose and would only wish the duck/hand was a bit lower. That aside this is very nice. Good light, color. Best of luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-11 14:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918552, 409213, 35947, '<td valign="top">Focus seems a little soft.  IMHO the composition could be improved.  There''s not a main focual point so a solid gathering of ducks with out the dark spot of nothing in the middle and right side would help.</td>', 'Focus seems a little soft.  IMHO the composition could be improved.  There''s not a main focual point so a solid gathering of ducks with out the dark spot of nothing in the middle and right side would help.', '2006-10-11 14:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918558, 409173, 35947, '<td valign="top">Love your title!  Don''t care much for your background choice.</td>', 'Love your title!  Don''t care much for your background choice.', '2006-10-11 14:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918563, 409823, 35947, '<td valign="top">Where''s the rubber ducky as stated in the challenge topic?</td>', 'Where''s the rubber ducky as stated in the challenge topic?', '2006-10-11 14:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918573, 409800, 35947, '<td valign="top">Very clever shot.  Wish the white wall on the left was replaced with a different background.</td>', 'Very clever shot.  Wish the white wall on the left was replaced with a different background.', '2006-10-11 14:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918582, 408922, 43828, '<td valign="top">Looks a little grainy, and needs more DOF. IMO the shot could have been done from a slightly different angle to allow the use of the tub/sink line for a horizontal straitening, instead of the back walls, this would also eliminate some of the shadows on the walls and allow for a better crop. JMO..</td>', 'Looks a little grainy, and needs more DOF. IMO the shot could have been done from a slightly different angle to allow the use of the tub/sink line for a horizontal straitening, instead of the back walls, this would also eliminate some of the shadows on the walls and allow for a better crop. JMO..', '2006-10-11 14:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918584, 407034, 35947, '<td valign="top">Great set-up.  Wish it was taken from a lower point of view.</td>', 'Great set-up.  Wish it was taken from a lower point of view.', '2006-10-11 14:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918585, 409629, 35947, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  Nice composition and use of natural lighting.</td>', 'Very cute!  Nice composition and use of natural lighting.', '2006-10-11 14:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918586, 407393, 35947, '<td valign="top">Very interesting postprocessing - makes it very arty!</td>', 'Very interesting postprocessing - makes it very arty!', '2006-10-11 14:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
