(2918590, 409654, 327, '<td valign="top">Little ducky gets lost in all the grape leaves. Nothing wrong with this just a tighter crop to bring him out as the main subject.</td>', 'Little ducky gets lost in all the grape leaves. Nothing wrong with this just a tighter crop to bring him out as the main subject.', '2006-10-11 14:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
