(2918611, 409823, 327, '<td valign="top">They are so pretty with all the colors. Love to see them and you did a good job. I think cropping off the bottom would of helped here. The white rock is a bit of a distraction.</td>', 'They are so pretty with all the colors. Love to see them and you did a good job. I think cropping off the bottom would of helped here. The white rock is a bit of a distraction.', '2006-10-11 14:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918637, 409830, 10858, '<td valign="top">I love the creativity of the idea here. Great play with shadows and lights.</td>', 'I love the creativity of the idea here. Great play with shadows and lights.', '2006-10-11 14:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2918642, 409803, 10858, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh. What did ducky do? Did he have a double acc or too many DQs? :-) I would place ducky a few cms further from the background, this way you could avoid harsh shadows and the feeling of the photo being flat (2 dimension alike).</td>', 'Made me laugh. What did ducky do? Did he have a double acc or too many DQs? :-) I would place ducky a few cms further from the background, this way you could avoid harsh shadows and the feeling of the photo being flat (2 dimension alike).', '2006-10-11 14:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
