(2919766, 409671, 60868, '<td valign="top">the ducks are very hard to observe. a different position (like behind the ducks) could have made a beter shot</td>', 'the ducks are very hard to observe. a different position (like behind the ducks) could have made a beter shot', '2006-10-11 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
