(2919771, 406886, 66341, '<td valign="top">Oo, nice. Had to look for several seconds to work out "is it or isn''t it?" Great idea. Well framed. Perfect lighting. Great exposures, though miniscule amounts are lost in the shadows. The "fill light" in Rawshooter might bring that out without losing other stuff. Really nice</td>', 'Oo, nice. Had to look for several seconds to work out "is it or isn''t it?" Great idea. Well framed. Perfect lighting. Great exposures, though miniscule amounts are lost in the shadows. The "fill light" in Rawshooter might bring that out without losing other stuff. Really nice', '2006-10-11 18:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919776, 409561, 60868, '<td valign="top">i don''t think that b/w had improved the image</td>', 'i don''t think that b/w had improved the image', '2006-10-11 18:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919781, 409556, 66341, '<td valign="top">A dirty duck! You deviant. Two things could give a bit more impact - having the duck facing into instead of out of the photo, and changing the angle very slightly to get direct eye contact.</td>', 'A dirty duck! You deviant. Two things could give a bit more impact - having the duck facing into instead of out of the photo, and changing the angle very slightly to get direct eye contact.', '2006-10-11 18:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919782, 406848, 60868, '<td valign="top">clean and neat</td>', 'clean and neat', '2006-10-11 18:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
