(2920064, 408322, 35513, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors in this shot and I like that it''s fairly busy.  There does appear to be some noise that''s viewable on the duck which I find a little distracting.  I think the composition of the photo does well....that little ducky is right in the middle of all that New York action!</td>', 'I really like the colors in this shot and I like that it''s fairly busy.  There does appear to be some noise that''s viewable on the duck which I find a little distracting.  I think the composition of the photo does well....that little ducky is right in the middle of all that New York action!', '2006-10-11 19:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920072, 408176, 35513, '<td valign="top">There are some really beautiful light patterns being reflected in this shot!  They really add something unique to the photo.  I like that you have a good, creative composition and idea.  I think perhaps the ducky would stand out better if there was just a little more light.....but as it looks like this was shot underwater that might have been hard :-)</td>', 'There are some really beautiful light patterns being reflected in this shot!  They really add something unique to the photo.  I like that you have a good, creative composition and idea.  I think perhaps the ducky would stand out better if there was just a little more light.....but as it looks like this was shot underwater that might have been hard :-)', '2006-10-11 19:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2920084, 408552, 35513, '<td valign="top">Certainly a hidden ducky!  Give it almost a "Where''s Waldo" kind of feel.  But I think that perhaps some plants with a variety of foliage (or perhaps...dare I say it?  Even flowers) might lend a little more interest to the shot.</td>', 'Certainly a hidden ducky!  Give it almost a "Where''s Waldo" kind of feel.  But I think that perhaps some plants with a variety of foliage (or perhaps...dare I say it?  Even flowers) might lend a little more interest to the shot.', '2006-10-11 19:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
