(2921667, 408624, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the man''s expression.  Something about the exposure.  I wonder if you played with levels and curves and brought up the saturation a bit if it wouldn''t really have the pop you were going for.  The composition is good.  The DOF puts the focus more on the man''s eyes. Maybe a wider aperture would have put the whole image in focus, which, in this case, could have incorporated the duck too. OR maybe focus on the duck and not the man. Cute idea~~</td>', 'I love the man''s expression.  Something about the exposure.  I wonder if you played with levels and curves and brought up the saturation a bit if it wouldn''t really have the pop you were going for.  The composition is good.  The DOF puts the focus more on the man''s eyes. Maybe a wider aperture would have put the whole image in focus, which, in this case, could have incorporated the duck too. OR maybe focus on the duck and not the man. Cute idea~~', '2006-10-12 10:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
