(2922534, 409484, 64623, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I like the PP.  A more natural picture would have been more pleasing to my eyes.</td>', 'I don''t think I like the PP.  A more natural picture would have been more pleasing to my eyes.', '2006-10-12 14:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922537, 409581, 64623, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen a ducky like that!  I think it might have been better if the background was one solid color.</td>', 'I''ve never seen a ducky like that!  I think it might have been better if the background was one solid color.', '2006-10-12 14:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922540, 408950, 64623, '<td valign="top">Oh, poor ducky!  I think it would have helped to have a deeper DOF so the whole duck and the bubbles were in focus.  Also, it would have been cool if somehow we could see more detail in the bubbles.</td>', 'Oh, poor ducky!  I think it would have helped to have a deeper DOF so the whole duck and the bubbles were in focus.  Also, it would have been cool if somehow we could see more detail in the bubbles.', '2006-10-12 14:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922542, 409741, 64446, '<td valign="top">Nice take. It evokes me Narnia...</td>', 'Nice take. It evokes me Narnia...', '2006-10-12 14:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922543, 408056, 64623, '<td valign="top">A different angle so we see more of the ducky might have been helpful.</td>', 'A different angle so we see more of the ducky might have been helpful.', '2006-10-12 14:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922545, 406737, 64623, '<td valign="top">Was the smoke added at PP?  It looks a little fake to me.</td>', 'Was the smoke added at PP?  It looks a little fake to me.', '2006-10-12 14:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922547, 409280, 64623, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this would be possible, but it might have been cool if you could put the ducky in front of a real soccer ball so he blends right in.  Just a thought!</td>', 'I don''t know if this would be possible, but it might have been cool if you could put the ducky in front of a real soccer ball so he blends right in.  Just a thought!', '2006-10-12 14:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922550, 409800, 64623, '<td valign="top">Cute!  Seems like the camera didn''t focus on the ducky right -- he seems just slightly out of focus.</td>', 'Cute!  Seems like the camera didn''t focus on the ducky right -- he seems just slightly out of focus.', '2006-10-12 14:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
