(2922822, 407575, 66341, '<td valign="top">(near?) perfect range of tones from black to white. Ducky is looking upwards towards the photo. I like te choice of crop</td>', '(near?) perfect range of tones from black to white. Ducky is looking upwards towards the photo. I like te choice of crop', '2006-10-12 15:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922838, 408520, 66341, '<td valign="top">I can''t put my finger on what I don''t like. Sorry. Everything seems right. It''s not the dirtyness or wornoutness of the ducks. I thought it might be the harsh shadows, but they''re wearing sunglasses. It might be that there''s no focal point in the photo or that the lines don''t lead my eye anywhere. Sorry I can''t be more helpful.</td>', 'I can''t put my finger on what I don''t like. Sorry. Everything seems right. It''s not the dirtyness or wornoutness of the ducks. I thought it might be the harsh shadows, but they''re wearing sunglasses. It might be that there''s no focal point in the photo or that the lines don''t lead my eye anywhere. Sorry I can''t be more helpful.', '2006-10-12 15:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
