(2922855, 409843, 66341, '<td valign="top">I love the composition. My daughter has the same ducks. Exposure seems dark at the top left, and also out of focus in the same place. Lack of DOF? Ignore the next comment if your bath is an ivory colour - the white balance doesn''t seem right. Niggle - there''s a black dot near the centre</td>', 'I love the composition. My daughter has the same ducks. Exposure seems dark at the top left, and also out of focus in the same place. Lack of DOF? Ignore the next comment if your bath is an ivory colour - the white balance doesn''t seem right. Niggle - there''s a black dot near the centre', '2006-10-12 15:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922861, 409382, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The duck is simply too small in proportion, consider getting as close and as low as possible for a more dramatic photo.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The duck is simply too small in proportion, consider getting as close and as low as possible for a more dramatic photo.', '2006-10-12 15:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922908, 407232, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Unfortunately, most color inversions end up with a perceived loss of detail, as in this case.  I think the normal color would do better.  Also consider a less symmetrical composition.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Unfortunately, most color inversions end up with a perceived loss of detail, as in this case.  I think the normal color would do better.  Also consider a less symmetrical composition.', '2006-10-12 15:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
