(2923516, 409231, 6179, '<td valign="top">Where is the duck?</td>', 'Where is the duck?', '2006-10-12 19:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923517, 407608, 14476, '<td valign="top">Sometimes I wonder just how people think these ideas up.  This is way over the top in the best possible way.<br/> <br/>I don''t know where you''ll finish in the scoring, but I''ll do my bit.  10</td>', 'Sometimes I wonder just how people think these ideas up.  This is way over the top in the best possible way. I don''t know where you''ll finish in the scoring, but I''ll do my bit.  10', '2006-10-12 19:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923519, 407864, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, dear.  The scene looks a little bleak, doesn''t it.  Although those red/browns are nice and rich.  Sadly, your duckie is a little hot and maybe just a touch oof.  Still, easily worth a 6.</td>', 'Oh, dear.  The scene looks a little bleak, doesn''t it.  Although those red/browns are nice and rich.  Sadly, your duckie is a little hot and maybe just a touch oof.  Still, easily worth a 6.', '2006-10-12 19:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923521, 406737, 14476, '<td valign="top">great title too.</td>', 'great title too.', '2006-10-12 19:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923523, 409753, 14476, '<td valign="top">I like the added attraction of the splash and you''re telling a cute story.  ON my monitor, this image seems just a little over exposed, but still it''s so sweet it rates a 6.</td>', 'I like the added attraction of the splash and you''re telling a cute story.  ON my monitor, this image seems just a little over exposed, but still it''s so sweet it rates a 6.', '2006-10-12 19:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
