(2923526, 407426, 14476, '<td valign="top">You sure do know how to get a gal''s attention!<br/> <br/>Nice one.</td>', 'You sure do know how to get a gal''s attention! Nice one.', '2006-10-12 19:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
