(2923530, 409394, 14476, '<td valign="top">Simple and nice.  Might be slightly better if that yellow label was either removed (if possible) or placed so it could be read.  One of those quirks of human nature:  If there''s writing, we''ll try to read it!  6</td>', 'Simple and nice.  Might be slightly better if that yellow label was either removed (if possible) or placed so it could be read.  One of those quirks of human nature:  If there''s writing, we''ll try to read it!  6', '2006-10-12 19:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
