(2923539, 409828, 14476, '<td valign="top">Great use of props for this sweet scene.<br/> <br/>Maybe, with advanced editing, a few edges could be just a touch cleaner.<br/>I like the picture on the wall.  Nice detail.</td>', 'Great use of props for this sweet scene. Maybe, with advanced editing, a few edges could be just a touch cleaner.I like the picture on the wall.  Nice detail.', '2006-10-12 19:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
