(2923542, 409512, 14476, '<td valign="top">Well, this is not the variety of little duckie that most people are using, but it sure is an artificial duck and in a lovely placement.  Excellent use of color.  6</td>', 'Well, this is not the variety of little duckie that most people are using, but it sure is an artificial duck and in a lovely placement.  Excellent use of color.  6', '2006-10-12 19:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
