(2924133, 407477, 60698, '<td valign="top">Fabulous! Where is this alien looking land/sea-scape?</td>', 'Fabulous! Where is this alien looking land/sea-scape?', '2006-10-12 22:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2924135, 409664, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, composition, colors, DOF choice, lighting, tear drop.  Bittersweet, sorrowful fun, oxymoron?  I like it.</td>', 'Nice idea, composition, colors, DOF choice, lighting, tear drop.  Bittersweet, sorrowful fun, oxymoron?  I like it.', '2006-10-12 22:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2924137, 406603, 60698, '<td valign="top">What a great eye you have! Very nice composition and PP.</td>', 'What a great eye you have! Very nice composition and PP.', '2006-10-12 22:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2924139, 409727, 60698, '<td valign="top">Love the dark water and the subtle reflection in it. I noticed that the reflection showed up better on a flat panel monitor. On a CRT the water looks dark. The yellow ducks stand out nicely and the arrangement is very good. There are no harsh shadows on the ducks or glare on the water. Its a lovely photo with good focus and soft lighting.</td>', 'Love the dark water and the subtle reflection in it. I noticed that the reflection showed up better on a flat panel monitor. On a CRT the water looks dark. The yellow ducks stand out nicely and the arrangement is very good. There are no harsh shadows on the ducks or glare on the water. Its a lovely photo with good focus and soft lighting.', '2006-10-12 22:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2924142, 407540, 44490, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective, nice DOF and composition.  I''m wondering how it would look/compare with the rod cloned out?</td>', 'Simple and effective, nice DOF and composition.  I''m wondering how it would look/compare with the rod cloned out?', '2006-10-12 22:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2924143, 409231, 66733, '<td valign="top">that is a well hidden ducky !</td>', 'that is a well hidden ducky !', '2006-10-12 23:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2924148, 407228, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice combination of natural and artificial, nice composition, DOF, color.  Effective, and I like it.</td>', 'Nice combination of natural and artificial, nice composition, DOF, color.  Effective, and I like it.', '2006-10-12 23:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2924150, 408842, 60698, '<td valign="top">Very high-tech! I just love it! Be interested to know how the green lighting effect was done if you choose to share. Love the CD''s. Imaginative and creative.</td>', 'Very high-tech! I just love it! Be interested to know how the green lighting effect was done if you choose to share. Love the CD''s. Imaginative and creative.', '2006-10-12 23:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2924155, 408928, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great idea, composition, low-angle perspective, and DOF.  I think that working in the ducky''s face would be better, but it would probably take some experimenting with either different arrangements or a different angle from the side.</td>', 'Great idea, composition, low-angle perspective, and DOF.  I think that working in the ducky''s face would be better, but it would probably take some experimenting with either different arrangements or a different angle from the side.', '2006-10-12 23:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2924156, 408481, 66733, '<td valign="top">wow... took me a bit to realize that ducky is not alone !!!<br/>great shot</td>', 'wow... took me a bit to realize that ducky is not alone !!!great shot', '2006-10-12 23:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
