(2924164, 406848, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice combination of natural and artificial, good arrangement, composition, perspective, sharpness and colors.  I think that the crop is a bit too tight, as the large duck seems overly dominant.  Just a thought, I like it.</td>', 'Nice combination of natural and artificial, good arrangement, composition, perspective, sharpness and colors.  I think that the crop is a bit too tight, as the large duck seems overly dominant.  Just a thought, I like it.', '2006-10-12 23:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
