(2924178, 408176, 60698, '<td valign="top">This photo is a really nice underwater shot and very funny. I keep trying to figure out what the blue thing is. Nice lighting.</td>', 'This photo is a really nice underwater shot and very funny. I keep trying to figure out what the blue thing is. Nice lighting.', '2006-10-12 23:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
