(2924704, 408917, 42601, '<td valign="top">Nice environment to shoot it in, although the light was really harsh. Was this taken midday? I would suggest soft afternoon or early morning light to get rid of those harsh shadows.</td>', 'Nice environment to shoot it in, although the light was really harsh. Was this taken midday? I would suggest soft afternoon or early morning light to get rid of those harsh shadows.', '2006-10-13 03:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2924707, 408520, 42601, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot! The only thing thats throwing me off a little, and this is from being super-critical - is the row of ducks on the right. They are a little too uniform for me, compared to the jumble of the rest. Otherwise, nice!</td>', 'Very nice shot! The only thing thats throwing me off a little, and this is from being super-critical - is the row of ducks on the right. They are a little too uniform for me, compared to the jumble of the rest. Otherwise, nice!', '2006-10-13 03:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
