(2924715, 409232, 42601, '<td valign="top">I like what you did here, cept the light seems a little wrong for me. If I couldnt see the bathtub/sink in the background and only the bubbles on a much tighter shot, or perhaps different angle - I think it wouldve been much more impactful.</td>', 'I like what you did here, cept the light seems a little wrong for me. If I couldnt see the bathtub/sink in the background and only the bubbles on a much tighter shot, or perhaps different angle - I think it wouldve been much more impactful.', '2006-10-13 03:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
