(2926207, 409280, 66654, '<td valign="top">Is the soccer ducky a soccer superstar? I like it. What was the final games score?</td>', 'Is the soccer ducky a soccer superstar? I like it. What was the final games score?', '2006-10-13 15:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2926218, 409779, 66654, '<td valign="top">He looks like a professional scuba diver. I like it. 8</td>', 'He looks like a professional scuba diver. I like it. 8', '2006-10-13 15:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2926318, 406848, 35513, '<td valign="top">Colors and lighting look pretty good on this shot, though the light is a little bit harsh on the leaf in the foreground.  I like that you included a grasshopper in this shot and the detail on it looks pretty good.  The image seems a little bit oversharpened to me, or perhaps the contrast is slightly high.</td>', 'Colors and lighting look pretty good on this shot, though the light is a little bit harsh on the leaf in the foreground.  I like that you included a grasshopper in this shot and the detail on it looks pretty good.  The image seems a little bit oversharpened to me, or perhaps the contrast is slightly high.', '2006-10-13 16:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2926322, 408332, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the side lighting on this shot...it sets the mood well.  I have to admit that I find the lettering on the duck to be rather distracting.  The colors in the shot look good and the background looks very even.</td>', 'I like the side lighting on this shot...it sets the mood well.  I have to admit that I find the lettering on the duck to be rather distracting.  The colors in the shot look good and the background looks very even.', '2006-10-13 16:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2926325, 407879, 35513, '<td valign="top">I really like the "lighter" tones of this photo....almost pastel.  To me, it''s really indicative of the title "Alone."  To the left of the duck, I can almost see some kind of line in the background, which stands out a bit because of the light coloring.  Other than that, I like the white background with this shot.</td>', 'I really like the "lighter" tones of this photo....almost pastel.  To me, it''s really indicative of the title "Alone."  To the left of the duck, I can almost see some kind of line in the background, which stands out a bit because of the light coloring.  Other than that, I like the white background with this shot.', '2006-10-13 17:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2926333, 407308, 35513, '<td valign="top">Colors on the duck and water are nice and vivid.  And I like the idea you have for the shot, but I think that I feel as though the targeting sight is too large a portion of the photo--distracting me from the nice colors of the ducky.</td>', 'Colors on the duck and water are nice and vivid.  And I like the idea you have for the shot, but I think that I feel as though the targeting sight is too large a portion of the photo--distracting me from the nice colors of the ducky.', '2006-10-13 17:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2926338, 409808, 35513, '<td valign="top">How cute!  I like this Halloween ducky :-)  Some of the colors/tones of the ground seem a little bit strange to me.  They look a little too red, or too orange--which kinda reminds me of Halloween, but doesn''t really look natural.</td>', 'How cute!  I like this Halloween ducky :-)  Some of the colors/tones of the ground seem a little bit strange to me.  They look a little too red, or too orange--which kinda reminds me of Halloween, but doesn''t really look natural.', '2006-10-13 17:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2926346, 407648, 35513, '<td valign="top">The focus on this photo seems to be a little soft.  I like the concept that you''re using for this shot, but you might consider putting the sun to your back when shooting with natural light so that the sky doesn''t get washed out.</td>', 'The focus on this photo seems to be a little soft.  I like the concept that you''re using for this shot, but you might consider putting the sun to your back when shooting with natural light so that the sky doesn''t get washed out.', '2006-10-13 17:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2926350, 408904, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good colors on the rubber ducky, but the lighting on the real duck seems to be a bit harsh.  It looks to me like it might have been an overcast day (not a lot you can do about that!) but we lose a lot of the detail in the mallard.</td>', 'Good colors on the rubber ducky, but the lighting on the real duck seems to be a bit harsh.  It looks to me like it might have been an overcast day (not a lot you can do about that!) but we lose a lot of the detail in the mallard.', '2006-10-13 17:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2926368, 408922, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this photo, with a ducky in both the foreground and the background.  But it seems as though the focus is a little soft on both of them.  I like the color choice of the background, though it tends to show noise a little more than lighter colors.</td>', 'I like the composition of this photo, with a ducky in both the foreground and the background.  But it seems as though the focus is a little soft on both of them.  I like the color choice of the background, though it tends to show noise a little more than lighter colors.', '2006-10-13 17:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2926373, 409561, 35513, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this shot looks ok to me, but I find the board (?) between the two ducks to be fairly distracting.  I might also suggest including the entire rubber duck in the frame of the shot, rather than the tail being cropped off.</td>', 'The lighting on this shot looks ok to me, but I find the board (?) between the two ducks to be fairly distracting.  I might also suggest including the entire rubber duck in the frame of the shot, rather than the tail being cropped off.', '2006-10-13 17:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2926378, 409459, 35513, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and the lighting on this shot, but I''m fairly distracted by the noise in the darker portions of the photo.  Focus looks good and colors look good too!</td>', 'I really like the composition and the lighting on this shot, but I''m fairly distracted by the noise in the darker portions of the photo.  Focus looks good and colors look good too!', '2006-10-13 17:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2926379, 409556, 35513, '<td valign="top">The focus on this shot seems to be on the ladybug, rather than strongly on the rubber ducky.</td>', 'The focus on this shot seems to be on the ladybug, rather than strongly on the rubber ducky.', '2006-10-13 17:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2926384, 409828, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea, and I like the pun!  The colors and contrast on this photo seem to be slightly off to me though.  They look almost muted.</td>', 'Very creative idea, and I like the pun!  The colors and contrast on this photo seem to be slightly off to me though.  They look almost muted.', '2006-10-13 17:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2926390, 407524, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept and composition, but I think you''ll find you score better by using the full image size allowed.  Colors look good and you''ve got an ducky that really works with your concept!</td>', 'Very nice concept and composition, but I think you''ll find you score better by using the full image size allowed.  Colors look good and you''ve got an ducky that really works with your concept!', '2006-10-13 17:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2926621, 409231, 44058, '<td valign="top">Where''s the ducky?</td>', 'Where''s the ducky?', '2006-10-13 19:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
