(2927246, 408624, 3102, '<td valign="top">An excellent character study -- a pleasant surprise in a challenge I''ve been rather disappointed in otherwise!</td>', 'An excellent character study -- a pleasant surprise in a challenge I''ve been rather disappointed in otherwise!', '2006-10-13 23:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927248, 409762, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple... good color contrasts... one of my favorites!</td>', 'Nice and simple... good color contrasts... one of my favorites!', '2006-10-13 23:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927438, 407308, 62895, '<td valign="top">Now that is really funny!</td>', 'Now that is really funny!', '2006-10-14 00:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927455, 408002, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the warm muted tones in this photo.  You''ve gotten the yellow of the duck to play off the colors in the leaves very well.  And the texture of the rock contrasts nicely with the smooth surface of the duck.</td>', 'I like the warm muted tones in this photo.  You''ve gotten the yellow of the duck to play off the colors in the leaves very well.  And the texture of the rock contrasts nicely with the smooth surface of the duck.', '2006-10-14 00:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927456, 409819, 35513, '<td valign="top">What a cutie!!  Lighting on this shot looks good...nice and even.  To improve the photo even more, I might suggest trying to find some kind of backdrop (rather than the carpet).  In the lower left corner, the texture of the carpet draws my eye away a bit.  I like the selective desat you''ve used here.  My only other wish would be that I could see this little cutie''s other eye!  :-)  But I know what it''s like trying to direct children.  Still a high score from me :-)</td>', 'What a cutie!!  Lighting on this shot looks good...nice and even.  To improve the photo even more, I might suggest trying to find some kind of backdrop (rather than the carpet).  In the lower left corner, the texture of the carpet draws my eye away a bit.  I like the selective desat you''ve used here.  My only other wish would be that I could see this little cutie''s other eye!  :-)  But I know what it''s like trying to direct children.  Still a high score from me :-)', '2006-10-14 00:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2927459, 407308, 67064, '<td valign="top">This is the best - it is a great visual and shows great humor!</td>', 'This is the best - it is a great visual and shows great humor!', '2006-10-14 00:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
