(2927508, 409671, 56744, '<td valign="top">Yep!... I found!... Three yellow duckyes and a black one?!?... (I''m just trying to say that it''s hard to find the main subject in this picture and the composition has too much distracting information). Try to keep only the bottom left quarter of the photo. It should work better. Anyway, good exposition and shutter speed.</td>', 'Yep!... I found!... Three yellow duckyes and a black one?!?... (I''m just trying to say that it''s hard to find the main subject in this picture and the composition has too much distracting information). Try to keep only the bottom left quarter of the photo. It should work better. Anyway, good exposition and shutter speed.', '2006-10-14 01:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
