(2928765, 409524, 60477, '<td valign="top">A little less lake in the set-up would have given the duck a bigger position...still a fine shot.</td>', 'A little less lake in the set-up would have given the duck a bigger position...still a fine shot.', '2006-10-14 18:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
