(2929310, 409361, 53243, '<td valign="top">The duck is not the central idea - I had to look for him.</td>', 'The duck is not the central idea - I had to look for him.', '2006-10-15 00:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2929403, 409231, 38648, '<td valign="top">So, where''s the duck?</td>', 'So, where''s the duck?', '2006-10-15 01:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2929593, 407608, 63970, '<td valign="top">Cute and creative!</td>', 'Cute and creative!', '2006-10-15 03:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2929594, 408128, 63970, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and placement of subject.</td>', 'Very nice colors and placement of subject.', '2006-10-15 03:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2929595, 409274, 63970, '<td valign="top">Great expression and lighting - unique.</td>', 'Great expression and lighting - unique.', '2006-10-15 03:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2929596, 409395, 63970, '<td valign="top">Twisted take on the challenge - I like it!!!</td>', 'Twisted take on the challenge - I like it!!!', '2006-10-15 03:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2929598, 409843, 63970, '<td valign="top">Very creative concept and good title!</td>', 'Very creative concept and good title!', '2006-10-15 03:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2929599, 408225, 63970, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea.  One of my favorites so far.</td>', 'Very creative idea.  One of my favorites so far.', '2006-10-15 03:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2929603, 406737, 63970, '<td valign="top">In all of my life I never thought I wouold see what I am looking at now.  Cool effect, the only wish I have is that I could see a little more of the "apprentice''s" Mullet?  (or whatever that hair-do is).</td>', 'In all of my life I never thought I wouold see what I am looking at now.  Cool effect, the only wish I have is that I could see a little more of the "apprentice''s" Mullet?  (or whatever that hair-do is).', '2006-10-15 03:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2929604, 409664, 63970, '<td valign="top">I almost didn''t see the tear - nice effect.</td>', 'I almost didn''t see the tear - nice effect.', '2006-10-15 03:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2929608, 408917, 63970, '<td valign="top">Cool surroundings and well placed subject.  I wonder what this shot would have looked like with the sun lighting the ducks face.</td>', 'Cool surroundings and well placed subject.  I wonder what this shot would have looked like with the sun lighting the ducks face.', '2006-10-15 03:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2929626, 409395, 43434, '<td valign="top">very small pciture ... pity cos it does seem to be good.</td>', 'very small pciture ... pity cos it does seem to be good.', '2006-10-15 04:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2929627, 407439, 43434, '<td valign="top">very small picture ... interesting though.</td>', 'very small picture ... interesting though.', '2006-10-15 04:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2929628, 407159, 43434, '<td valign="top">tiny picture.</td>', 'tiny picture.', '2006-10-15 04:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930197, 407657, 64623, '<td valign="top">I would like all the ducks to be in focus.</td>', 'I would like all the ducks to be in focus.', '2006-10-15 14:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930199, 409843, 64623, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the coloring.  The whites should be more white.  It maybe needs more contrast too.  But a very creative idea!</td>', 'I don''t like the coloring.  The whites should be more white.  It maybe needs more contrast too.  But a very creative idea!', '2006-10-15 14:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930201, 407879, 64623, '<td valign="top">Needs more contrast.</td>', 'Needs more contrast.', '2006-10-15 14:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930205, 407282, 64623, '<td valign="top">I don''t like that you can see the reflection of the room in all the magnets.</td>', 'I don''t like that you can see the reflection of the room in all the magnets.', '2006-10-15 14:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930209, 409446, 64623, '<td valign="top">Wrong kind of ducky!</td>', 'Wrong kind of ducky!', '2006-10-15 14:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930211, 408519, 64623, '<td valign="top">Why is the water red?  It looks so unnatural.</td>', 'Why is the water red?  It looks so unnatural.', '2006-10-15 14:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930213, 407469, 64623, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene.  I''m just not sure I like the reflections on the water.</td>', 'Pretty scene.  I''m just not sure I like the reflections on the water.', '2006-10-15 14:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930215, 409352, 64623, '<td valign="top">The background is too busy.</td>', 'The background is too busy.', '2006-10-15 14:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930217, 409361, 64623, '<td valign="top">It would be easier to see the duckies if you were on a less-busy background.</td>', 'It would be easier to see the duckies if you were on a less-busy background.', '2006-10-15 14:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930219, 409823, 64623, '<td valign="top">Wrong kind of ducky!</td>', 'Wrong kind of ducky!', '2006-10-15 14:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930220, 408481, 64623, '<td valign="top">Is that a REAL alligator?  Or crocodile?  Your picture seems very noisy.</td>', 'Is that a REAL alligator?  Or crocodile?  Your picture seems very noisy.', '2006-10-15 14:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930221, 409569, 64623, '<td valign="top">Duckies need to be lighter.</td>', 'Duckies need to be lighter.', '2006-10-15 14:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930223, 406734, 64623, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot, but I can''t tell what it is that ducky''s sitting on.</td>', 'Very pretty shot, but I can''t tell what it is that ducky''s sitting on.', '2006-10-15 14:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930305, 406603, 39702, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  Love the perspective and use of color. Blue ribbon IMHO. 9</td>', 'Excellent shot.  Love the perspective and use of color. Blue ribbon IMHO. 9', '2006-10-15 15:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930576, 408428, 59564, '<td valign="top">I think the reflections add a lot to this photo. The negative space also makes this photo work really well.  Great job!</td>', 'I think the reflections add a lot to this photo. The negative space also makes this photo work really well.  Great job!', '2006-10-15 18:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930581, 409741, 59564, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo even without woody and the duck but as odd as it may sound I believe they do add a lot to the photo.  I like the soft lighting on the duck and the tender relationship the woody and the duck share.  Yeah, they may fight a lot but at the end of the day Woody still cares enough to hold shorty up to see everything :)  Great job.</td>', 'This is a great photo even without woody and the duck but as odd as it may sound I believe they do add a lot to the photo.  I like the soft lighting on the duck and the tender relationship the woody and the duck share.  Yeah, they may fight a lot but at the end of the day Woody still cares enough to hold shorty up to see everything :)  Great job.', '2006-10-15 18:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930583, 407232, 59564, '<td valign="top">This is different.  I really like it.  The whole photo seems tilted a bit and it''s throwin me off...but in a good way...I think.  After I look at it for a second it kind of looks like the two closest ducks are eating the duck facing the camera, which I will always appreciate.</td>', 'This is different.  I really like it.  The whole photo seems tilted a bit and it''s throwin me off...but in a good way...I think.  After I look at it for a second it kind of looks like the two closest ducks are eating the duck facing the camera, which I will always appreciate.', '2006-10-15 18:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930585, 409361, 59564, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea!  Only thing I could suggest would be to bring out the duckies more.  Mabe dodging them a little would have helped.  In either case I really like this photo and setup.</td>', 'Very creative idea!  Only thing I could suggest would be to bring out the duckies more.  Mabe dodging them a little would have helped.  In either case I really like this photo and setup.', '2006-10-15 18:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930591, 407393, 59564, '<td valign="top">Wow this feels really dreamy.  Normally that much pink would make my retinas sting a little but I feel like it works really well here.  That must be either a really big ducky or a really small Buddha :)</td>', 'Wow this feels really dreamy.  Normally that much pink would make my retinas sting a little but I feel like it works really well here.  That must be either a really big ducky or a really small Buddha :)', '2006-10-15 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930598, 406603, 59564, '<td valign="top">I never thought I would say this about a ducky picture but this is really awesome.  I feel like this would be a photo that would really appeal to me even without the duck but having the duck there as a focal point really ties it all in.  Great job!</td>', 'I never thought I would say this about a ducky picture but this is really awesome.  I feel like this would be a photo that would really appeal to me even without the duck but having the duck there as a focal point really ties it all in.  Great job!', '2006-10-15 18:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930606, 408950, 59564, '<td valign="top">Really great framing.  I feel like the duck is relaxing.  Even though we all know that ducks (or duckies) float on the water he has run a nice bath to submerge himself in the bubbles. awesome.</td>', 'Really great framing.  I feel like the duck is relaxing.  Even though we all know that ducks (or duckies) float on the water he has run a nice bath to submerge himself in the bubbles. awesome.', '2006-10-15 18:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930613, 406157, 59564, '<td valign="top">I wonder how a different crop may have changed the feel of the photo?  If you were to crop out a little more of the grass in the bottom of the photo which would bring the ducks in a little closer.  The duck on the left looks like he is about to pop :)</td>', 'I wonder how a different crop may have changed the feel of the photo?  If you were to crop out a little more of the grass in the bottom of the photo which would bring the ducks in a little closer.  The duck on the left looks like he is about to pop :)', '2006-10-15 19:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930615, 409492, 59564, '<td valign="top">There is a reflection in the glass right about the ducks head that is distracting me a little but I love the simplicity of this photo.  I really like this.  Even down to the reflection of the duck in the stem of the glass.</td>', 'There is a reflection in the glass right about the ducks head that is distracting me a little but I love the simplicity of this photo.  I really like this.  Even down to the reflection of the duck in the stem of the glass.', '2006-10-15 19:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930617, 407159, 59564, '<td valign="top">Not to beat a dead horse but it''s a little small.  I do like the colors though just wish it was a bit bigger.</td>', 'Not to beat a dead horse but it''s a little small.  I do like the colors though just wish it was a bit bigger.', '2006-10-15 19:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930621, 409475, 59564, '<td valign="top">I love your use of natural light!  It looks so...um...natural :)  The way you setup this shot immediately takes my eye to the duck and makes it actually a little hard to take my eye away from it.  Especially his eye.  I feel like we are in a staring contest and he is winning.  I think you have done a fantasic job!</td>', 'I love your use of natural light!  It looks so...um...natural :)  The way you setup this shot immediately takes my eye to the duck and makes it actually a little hard to take my eye away from it.  Especially his eye.  I feel like we are in a staring contest and he is winning.  I think you have done a fantasic job!', '2006-10-15 19:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930623, 409834, 59564, '<td valign="top">Your cats eyes are beautiful!</td>', 'Your cats eyes are beautiful!', '2006-10-15 19:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930624, 409448, 59564, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  I like your ducky too, he has a little hair curl :)</td>', 'Very nice photo.  I like your ducky too, he has a little hair curl :)', '2006-10-15 19:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930632, 408843, 59564, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if I see a Romantic Ducky (except maybe the eyes) but the first thoughts I had when I saw the photo was that he was being abducted.  The spirals give me a feeling like he is getting ready be lifted up.  Even if that was not your intention then I really like it.</td>', 'I don''t know if I see a Romantic Ducky (except maybe the eyes) but the first thoughts I had when I saw the photo was that he was being abducted.  The spirals give me a feeling like he is getting ready be lifted up.  Even if that was not your intention then I really like it.', '2006-10-15 19:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930641, 407308, 59564, '<td valign="top">Wonderful setup and creativity :) Everything about this picture is perfect to me.  The way his eyes are kind of buggy and crossed like he is looking straight down the barrel of judgement/justice.  Colors are beautiful and his reflection in the water tops it off for me.  Great job!</td>', 'Wonderful setup and creativity :) Everything about this picture is perfect to me.  The way his eyes are kind of buggy and crossed like he is looking straight down the barrel of judgement/justice.  Colors are beautiful and his reflection in the water tops it off for me.  Great job!', '2006-10-15 19:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930643, 408128, 59564, '<td valign="top">I really like your setup and idea.  The photo seems to have to much of a red tint for me but it could just be the red leaves taking over the color space.</td>', 'I really like your setup and idea.  The photo seems to have to much of a red tint for me but it could just be the red leaves taking over the color space.', '2006-10-15 19:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930644, 408958, 59564, '<td valign="top">lol :)  Great.  Even down to the expression on the duckies face.  I think the bowl could stand to be a little better lit but nevertheless a great photo.</td>', 'lol :)  Great.  Even down to the expression on the duckies face.  I think the bowl could stand to be a little better lit but nevertheless a great photo.', '2006-10-15 19:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930650, 407575, 59564, '<td valign="top">awesome creativity :)  I really like how you have composed this photo.</td>', 'awesome creativity :)  I really like how you have composed this photo.', '2006-10-15 19:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930655, 409382, 59564, '<td valign="top">Maybe shooting from street level to give the duck a little larger look.  I like his fire outfit though :)</td>', 'Maybe shooting from street level to give the duck a little larger look.  I like his fire outfit though :)', '2006-10-15 19:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930659, 409280, 59564, '<td valign="top">As I go through this challenge I have become amazed at how many variations you can get a rubber ducky with :)</td>', 'As I go through this challenge I have become amazed at how many variations you can get a rubber ducky with :)', '2006-10-15 19:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930671, 409762, 59564, '<td valign="top">My first thought with this is that it <i>feels</i> really dreamy.  The background is awesome.  You have done a wonderful job at getting a feeling to come through the photo, the title is not even needed on this.  <br/> <br/>I never though I would really go on this much about a ducky photo :)</td>', 'My first thought with this is that it feels really dreamy.  The background is awesome.  You have done a wonderful job at getting a feeling to come through the photo, the title is not even needed on this.   I never though I would really go on this much about a ducky photo :)', '2006-10-15 19:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930673, 409569, 59564, '<td valign="top">Great lighting on the duckies!</td>', 'Great lighting on the duckies!', '2006-10-15 19:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930677, 409610, 59564, '<td valign="top">I like the colors you have choosen.  I would like to see this without the table visible.  Maybe shooting from a lower angle so all you can see is the background and the ducks.  Either way I think it is a great photo.</td>', 'I like the colors you have choosen.  I would like to see this without the table visible.  Maybe shooting from a lower angle so all you can see is the background and the ducks.  Either way I think it is a great photo.', '2006-10-15 19:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930678, 409757, 59564, '<td valign="top">The two flash hot spots on either side of the ducks head are a little distracting but I love the colors!</td>', 'The two flash hot spots on either side of the ducks head are a little distracting but I love the colors!', '2006-10-15 19:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930687, 409484, 59564, '<td valign="top">Very interesting!  This has a very artsy feel to it and I really like it.  I''m glad you had the guts to go with this look because a lot of people (probably myself included) would have went with a more traditional look since even without processing this looks like a really nice photo.  You didn''t.  You took another approach and because of it I got to see an awesome photo. Thank you.</td>', 'Very interesting!  This has a very artsy feel to it and I really like it.  I''m glad you had the guts to go with this look because a lot of people (probably myself included) would have went with a more traditional look since even without processing this looks like a really nice photo.  You didn''t.  You took another approach and because of it I got to see an awesome photo. Thank you.', '2006-10-15 19:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930695, 409370, 59564, '<td valign="top">I have tried so many times to get a moon shot to come out like this. awesome. I don''t know if I see the connection to this challenge but still a <i>great</i> photo.</td>', 'I have tried so many times to get a moon shot to come out like this. awesome. I don''t know if I see the connection to this challenge but still a great photo.', '2006-10-15 19:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930701, 408433, 59564, '<td valign="top">The duck seems a little bright but I like his sun glasses :)</td>', 'The duck seems a little bright but I like his sun glasses :)', '2006-10-15 19:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930704, 407330, 59564, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape and idea!</td>', 'Beautiful landscape and idea!', '2006-10-15 19:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930705, 408332, 59564, '<td valign="top">You have done a wonderful job with lighting.</td>', 'You have done a wonderful job with lighting.', '2006-10-15 19:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930868, 409231, 24528, '<td valign="top">Not seeing it... sorry</td>', 'Not seeing it... sorry', '2006-10-15 21:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930872, 409370, 24528, '<td valign="top">DUCKY?</td>', 'DUCKY?', '2006-10-15 21:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2930897, 409610, 60914, '<td valign="top">I like this, I wish the framing/cropping were slightly different, as the pink duck has less background color in front of its beak/nose than the green one</td>', 'I like this, I wish the framing/cropping were slightly different, as the pink duck has less background color in front of its beak/nose than the green one', '2006-10-15 21:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
