(2936301, 407159, 67006, '<td valign="top">I new to photography, but this one really appeals to me!</td>', 'I new to photography, but this one really appeals to me!', '2006-10-17 12:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936478, 409091, 64175, '<td valign="top">ROFL.  Oh my gosh, this is freakin'' hillarious.  Where in the world does one get a JB duck.  Laugh factor gets you a 9 on this one.  A 10 would come from a different background (a bit too much on the greenish hue--would like more contrast.).</td>', 'ROFL.  Oh my gosh, this is freakin'' hillarious.  Where in the world does one get a JB duck.  Laugh factor gets you a 9 on this one.  A 10 would come from a different background (a bit too much on the greenish hue--would like more contrast.).', '2006-10-17 13:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936479, 409022, 64175, '<td valign="top">Nice color contrast.  8.</td>', 'Nice color contrast.  8.', '2006-10-17 13:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936483, 407575, 64175, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Funny title. I like it. 7.  If the pink ducks head was turned just a bit more to the left facing green ''speaking'' duck, it would probably warrant an 8-9.</td>', 'Nice shot. Funny title. I like it. 7.  If the pink ducks head was turned just a bit more to the left facing green ''speaking'' duck, it would probably warrant an 8-9.', '2006-10-17 13:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936487, 407469, 64175, '<td valign="top">The ducks seem like they are propped in front of a monitor or maybe a ledge over the lake. So, I don''t really get that they are floating, but it is a nice shot.  7.</td>', 'The ducks seem like they are propped in front of a monitor or maybe a ledge over the lake. So, I don''t really get that they are floating, but it is a nice shot.  7.', '2006-10-17 13:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936498, 407393, 64175, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this was processed as a Soft image, but the whole photo has a very soft feel and I think would have shown better if the focus was sharper on the duck.</td>', 'I''m not sure if this was processed as a Soft image, but the whole photo has a very soft feel and I think would have shown better if the focus was sharper on the duck.', '2006-10-17 13:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936510, 409173, 64175, '<td valign="top">The ducky and the title are both great but the lines of the towel are a bit distracting.  A different background would help enhance this background. Perhaps shooting it on an open phone book or something in relation to a scenario related to the phone.</td>', 'The ducky and the title are both great but the lines of the towel are a bit distracting.  A different background would help enhance this background. Perhaps shooting it on an open phone book or something in relation to a scenario related to the phone.', '2006-10-17 13:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936512, 407033, 64175, '<td valign="top">The flash around the duck''s eye is a bit distracting, but the rest of the photo composition is nice.</td>', 'The flash around the duck''s eye is a bit distracting, but the rest of the photo composition is nice.', '2006-10-17 13:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936516, 406737, 64175, '<td valign="top">Old man needs a tuft of white hair or something. Right now it looks like string glued on or that he did not wipe his mouth after eating.  Great concept and composition.</td>', 'Old man needs a tuft of white hair or something. Right now it looks like string glued on or that he did not wipe his mouth after eating.  Great concept and composition.', '2006-10-17 13:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936517, 409821, 64175, '<td valign="top">I think this one would hav been better if the Have A Nice Day/Pay thing was more in focus and if the duck was turned just a bit more to the side hiding the hole in its beack and showing less of the molded seam.</td>', 'I think this one would hav been better if the Have A Nice Day/Pay thing was more in focus and if the duck was turned just a bit more to the side hiding the hole in its beack and showing less of the molded seam.', '2006-10-17 13:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936523, 406886, 64175, '<td valign="top">The image just comes off a bit flat. Not enough contrast. Perhaps different lighting position to create more shadow or a bit darker frame. Just a bit too many grays in relation to blacks/whites.</td>', 'The image just comes off a bit flat. Not enough contrast. Perhaps different lighting position to create more shadow or a bit darker frame. Just a bit too many grays in relation to blacks/whites.', '2006-10-17 13:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936527, 407854, 64175, '<td valign="top">I would prefer the image to be a little brighter. I don'' know if it was post porcessing causing the vignetting or the lighting itself, but the image is a bit too dark.  You may also want to clone out the flash above the birds beak and the belly as it is a little distracting.</td>', 'I would prefer the image to be a little brighter. I don'' know if it was post porcessing causing the vignetting or the lighting itself, but the image is a bit too dark.  You may also want to clone out the flash above the birds beak and the belly as it is a little distracting.', '2006-10-17 13:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936531, 409808, 64175, '<td valign="top">There are portions of the bottom of the photo (leaves) that are a bit blown out by the flash or lighting.  They take away from a very creative photo.</td>', 'There are portions of the bottom of the photo (leaves) that are a bit blown out by the flash or lighting.  They take away from a very creative photo.', '2006-10-17 13:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936534, 409819, 64175, '<td valign="top">A little faster shutter would have eliminated the blur you get on the duck in his right hand.  I like the use of the select color.</td>', 'A little faster shutter would have eliminated the blur you get on the duck in his right hand.  I like the use of the select color.', '2006-10-17 13:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936538, 408428, 64175, '<td valign="top">The ducks come off just a little out of focus. Nice shot overall and good use of creative elements like the black background and reflective pool.</td>', 'The ducks come off just a little out of focus. Nice shot overall and good use of creative elements like the black background and reflective pool.', '2006-10-17 13:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
