(2936545, 408830, 64175, '<td valign="top">Not sure if it is dust on the filter or sensor of the camera of white specks in the watter, but it takes away from the quality of the image.</td>', 'Not sure if it is dust on the filter or sensor of the camera of white specks in the watter, but it takes away from the quality of the image.', '2006-10-17 13:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
