(2936934, 408928, 66654, '<td valign="top">It is blurry and I can''t see the ducky''s face. It is a great idea. It needs to be less blurry. The ducky could be at a different angle. Show his face.</td>', 'It is blurry and I can''t see the ducky''s face. It is a great idea. It needs to be less blurry. The ducky could be at a different angle. Show his face.', '2006-10-17 16:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
