(2940073, 407575, 64175, '<td valign="top">Wow, all I can see is silly, silly, silly voters.  What the HECK were you thinking by not having this as a top 10.  Still agree that the pink duck needs to be turned a bit, but this was one of the most clever of the group and having seen what made the top 20, I have no idea what many were thinking. Not that they were bad shots by any means, but they certainly were not as good as this one IMO.<br/> <br/>Keep up the good work.  The voters will come around.<br/> <br/>It was a sure fire 8 in my book. (changed from my original 7).<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-18 10:10:36.</i></td>', 'Wow, all I can see is silly, silly, silly voters.  What the HECK were you thinking by not having this as a top 10.  Still agree that the pink duck needs to be turned a bit, but this was one of the most clever of the group and having seen what made the top 20, I have no idea what many were thinking. Not that they were bad shots by any means, but they certainly were not as good as this one IMO. Keep up the good work.  The voters will come around. It was a sure fire 8 in my book. (changed from my original 7).', '2006-10-18 11:09:30.000000', '2006-10-18 11:10:36.000000', 0),
(2940087, 406603, 32968, '<td valign="top">I have to say, I''ve never seen such a powerful rubber ducky! Those words really don''t mix well but you made it work on "digital film". It feels there''s a whole fleet of duckys out there calling him to come with them, but we can''t see them! Nice job with the pic, and fierce modelling as well (for someone named ducky!)</td>', 'I have to say, I''ve never seen such a powerful rubber ducky! Those words really don''t mix well but you made it work on "digital film". It feels there''s a whole fleet of duckys out there calling him to come with them, but we can''t see them! Nice job with the pic, and fierce modelling as well (for someone named ducky!)', '2006-10-18 11:16:37.000000', NULL, 0),
