(2940144, 409022, 64175, '<td valign="top">I had actually upped this one from an 8 to a 9.  Really, really did not get its rightful score.  Never sure what voters are thinking based on some of the ones above it.  It was a top 10 in the competition.  Voters?????!</td>', 'I had actually upped this one from an 8 to a 9.  Really, really did not get its rightful score.  Never sure what voters are thinking based on some of the ones above it.  It was a top 10 in the competition.  Voters?????!', '2006-10-18 11:35:06.000000', NULL, 0),
