(2940158, 409388, 64175, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Trumpeteer4:</b></div><hr/><i> The duckies look like an afterthought. The dog is what my eye travels to. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Correct, the dog is the subject so your eyes should be traveling to it.  The challenge is to "Include" a rubber ducky in the photo, not make the rubber ducky the "subject" of the photo.<br/> <br/>Also, it is a Golden Retriever which are game (bird) retrieval animals, so the two IMO are perfectly related and a great match.  Slightly average to marginally above average shot IMO, but defintely challenge material.  I had it projected as about a 5 going into the competition and still do in relation to the competition.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-18 10:56:42.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Trumpeteer4: The duckies look like an afterthought. The dog is what my eye travels to.  Correct, the dog is the subject so your eyes should be traveling to it.  The challenge is to "Include" a rubber ducky in the photo, not make the rubber ducky the "subject" of the photo. Also, it is a Golden Retriever which are game (bird) retrieval animals, so the two IMO are perfectly related and a great match.  Slightly average to marginally above average shot IMO, but defintely challenge material.  I had it projected as about a 5 going into the competition and still do in relation to the competition.', '2006-10-18 11:40:26.000000', '2006-10-18 11:56:42.000000', 0),
(2940325, 409388, 35947, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a little harsh.  The bottom right has a hot spot which grabs my eye.</td>', 'The lighting seems a little harsh.  The bottom right has a hot spot which grabs my eye.', '2006-10-18 12:35:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2940357, 407200, 50231, '<td valign="top">Jimmy loved the shot! I thought to my self man that guy has a TON of duckies. LOL It was a great season and we put it to them. It is a pleasure having you as my teammate and lets get them in WPL3!</td>', 'Jimmy loved the shot! I thought to my self man that guy has a TON of duckies. LOL It was a great season and we put it to them. It is a pleasure having you as my teammate and lets get them in WPL3!', '2006-10-18 12:43:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2940372, 407647, 50231, '<td valign="top">Awesome Judi! This is wonderful image. Man you got allot of duckies! :-P<br/> <br/>Thanks again for the gift and for being an amazing person and fantastic teammate.</td>', 'Awesome Judi! This is wonderful image. Man you got allot of duckies! :-P Thanks again for the gift and for being an amazing person and fantastic teammate.', '2006-10-18 12:48:19.000000', NULL, 0),
