(2945695, 409716, 52854, '<td valign="top">Hi - I like your original entry. It''s a good, soft focus shot with decent shadow and reflection. Both takes are a little on the dark side. Neither photo shows enough light to make it any more dramatic than what it is. On the other hand, they both have a peacefulness about them. I had some issues with my entry too - I decided it might be a good time to let go of the ducky''s - a new challenge is at the train station up head! <br/></td>', 'Hi - I like your original entry. It''s a good, soft focus shot with decent shadow and reflection. Both takes are a little on the dark side. Neither photo shows enough light to make it any more dramatic than what it is. On the other hand, they both have a peacefulness about them. I had some issues with my entry too - I decided it might be a good time to let go of the ducky''s - a new challenge is at the train station up head! ', '2006-10-19 23:32:52.000000', NULL, 0),
